{"id":"501645","name":"冬瓜豆腐三鲜汤","author":"董小伊","authorId":"11890971","desc":"","cover":"images/501645/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"一块"},{"name":"笔管鱼","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"一小块"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜碎","amount":"一些"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"一点"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冬瓜一块。","img":"images/501645/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"改刀切小块。","img":"images/501645/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆腐切小块。","img":"images/501645/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"辅料备用。","img":"images/501645/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"新鲜笔管鱼。","img":"images/501645/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油加入葱花爆香然后加入冬瓜翻炒。","img":"images/501645/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒一会就把豆腐加入然后加清水。","img":"images/501645/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"水烧开后。","img":"images/501645/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入笔管大火煮2分加盐调味。","img":"images/501645/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后勾薄芡加入黄瓜丝香菜段就可以了。","img":"images/501645/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"笔管鱼这个颜色就刚刚好。","img":"images/501645/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"这个汤就是鲜。","img":"images/501645/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/501645/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}